    "Delete “%@” from this Mac’s Steam library and Loomscreen to free space. This cannot be undone; the wallpaper can be downloaded again. Steam subscriptions are unchanged." : {
      "comment" : "Destructive confirmation for a locally managed Workshop wallpaper. %@ is its title. Deletes local files, does not unsubscribe on Steam.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete “%@” from this Mac’s Steam library and Loomscreen to free space. This cannot be undone; the wallpaper can be downloaded again. Steam subscriptions are unchanged."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elimina «%@» de la biblioteca de Steam de este Mac y de Loomscreen para liberar espacio. No se puede deshacer, pero el fondo se puede descargar de nuevo. Las suscripciones de Steam no cambian."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この Mac の Steam ライブラリと Loomscreen から「%@」を削除して空き容量を増やします。取り消せませんが、壁紙は再ダウンロードできます。Steam のサブスクリプションは変更されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从本机 Steam 库和 Loomscreen 删除“%@”以释放空间。此操作无法撤销，可重新下载；Steam 订阅不变。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從這台 Mac 的 Steam 收藏庫和 Loomscreen 刪除「%@」以釋放空間。此操作無法復原，可重新下載；Steam 訂閱不變。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Löschen Sie „%@“ aus der Steam-Bibliothek dieses Macs und Loomscreen, um Platz zu sparen. Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden; der Hintergrundbild kann erneut heruntergeladen werden. Steam-Abonnements bleiben unverändert."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supprimez «%@» de cette bibliothèque Steam de ce Mac et Loomscreen pour libérer de l'espace. Cela ne peut pas être annulé ; l'image d'arrière-plan peut être téléchargée à nouveau. Les abonnements Steam ne sont pas modifiés."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac의 Steam 라이브러리와 Loomscreen에서 “%@”을 삭제하여 공간을 확보하세요. 이는 되돌릴 수 없습니다. 배경화면을 다시 다운로드할 수 있습니다. Steam 구독은 변경되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exclua “%@” desta biblioteca Steam do Mac e Loomscreen para liberar espaço. Isso não pode ser revertido; o papel de parede pode ser baixada novamente. As assinaturas Steam não são alteradas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
