    "In Steam connection, choose or authorize your Steam library folder. This grants Loomscreen access to local Workshop files; it does not sign you in. Follow the folder picker's instructions, then check the library status." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Steam connection, choose or authorize your Steam library folder. This grants Loomscreen access to local Workshop files; it does not sign you in. Follow the folder picker's instructions, then check the library status."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Conexión de Steam, elige o autoriza la carpeta de tu biblioteca. Esto permite acceder a los archivos locales de Workshop; no inicia sesión. Sigue las instrucciones del selector y comprueba el estado de la biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 接続でライブラリフォルダを選択または許可します。これにより Loomscreen がローカルのワークショップファイルにアクセスできますが、ログインは別途必要です。フォルダ選択画面の案内に従い、ライブラリの状態を確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Steam 连接中选择或授权 Steam 库文件夹，让 Loomscreen 访问本地创意工坊文件；这一步不会登录账号。按文件夹选择窗口的提示操作，然后检查 Steam 库状态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Steam 連線中選擇或授權 Steam 收藏庫資料夾，讓 Loomscreen 存取本機工作坊檔案；這一步不會登入帳號。依照資料夾選擇視窗的提示操作，然後檢查收藏庫狀態。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In der Verbindung Steam wählen oder autorisieren Sie Ihren Steam-Mediathekordner. Dadurch erhält Loomscreen Zugriff auf lokale Workshop-Dateien; Sie werden nicht angemeldet. Befolgen Sie die Anweisungen des Ordnerwählers und überprüfen Sie anschließend den Status der Mediathek."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans la connexion Steam, choisissez ou autorisez votre dossier de bibliothèque Steam. Cela accorde Loomscreen accès aux fichiers du laboratoire locaux ; cela ne vous connecte pas. Suivez les instructions du sélecteur de dossiers, puis vérifiez l'état de la bibliothèque."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 연결에서 Steam 라이브러리 폴더를 선택하거나 승인하십시오. 이를 통해 Loomscreen가 로컬 워크숍 파일에 액세스할 수 있습니다. 로그인하지는 않습니다. 폴더 선택기를 따르고 라이브러리 상태를 확인하십시오."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na conexão Steam, escolha ou autorize sua pasta de biblioteca Steam. Isso concede Loomscreen acesso aos arquivos do Workshop locais; não faz com que você faça login. Siga as instruções do selecionador de pastas e, em seguida, verifique o status da biblioteca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In System Settings › Wallpaper, choose the Loomscreen tile for each display. macOS then plays what that display shows in Loomscreen, even with Loomscreen closed." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding guide for the System Wallpaper page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In System Settings › Wallpaper, choose the Loomscreen tile for each display. macOS then plays what that display shows in Loomscreen, even with Loomscreen closed."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Ajustes del Sistema › Fondo de pantalla, elige el mosaico de Loomscreen en cada pantalla. Después macOS reproduce lo que esa pantalla muestra en Loomscreen, incluso con Loomscreen cerrado."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "システム設定 › 壁紙で、各ディスプレイに Loomscreen のタイルを選びます。以後、Loomscreen を終了していても、そのディスプレイで Loomscreen が表示している壁紙を macOS が再生します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“系统设置 › 墙纸”里为每台显示器选择 Loomscreen 的磁贴。之后即使关闭 Loomscreen，macOS 也会播放这台显示器在 Loomscreen 里显示的壁纸。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「系統設定 › 背景圖片」裡為每台顯示器選擇 Loomscreen 的拼貼。之後即使關閉 Loomscreen，macOS 也會播放這台顯示器在 Loomscreen 裡顯示的桌布。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Systemeinstellungen › Hintergrundbild wählen Sie für jedes Display die Loomscreen-Kachel aus. macOS spielt dann das, was dieses Display in Loomscreen anzeigt, auch wenn Loomscreen geschlossen ist."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans Réglages Système › Fond d'écran, choisissez la tuile Loomscreen pour chaque écran. macOS joue ensuite ce que cet écran affiche dans Loomscreen, même si Loomscreen est fermé."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "시스템 설정 › 배경화면에서 각 디스플레이에 대해 Loomscreen 타일을 선택합니다. macOS는 Loomscreen가 닫혀 있더라도 Loomscreen에 표시된 내용을 재생합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Em Ajustes do Sistema › papel de parede, escolha a grade Loomscreen para cada tela. macOS então reproduz o que essa tela mostra em Loomscreen, mesmo com Loomscreen fechado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In use on %@" : {
      "comment" : "The displays a wallpaper is set on, drawing it or not: the Workshop inspector, and VoiceOver on a wallpaper card none of them is playing. Placeholder is a list of display names.",
      "localizations" : {
