    "LiveWallpaper will release its read access to the local Apple Aerials folder. Existing aerial wallpapers stay applied; you'll need to reconnect to browse the library again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen will release its read access to the local Apple Aerials folder. Existing aerial wallpapers stay applied; you'll need to reconnect to browse the library again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen liberará el acceso de lectura a la carpeta local de vistas aéreas de Apple. Los fondos de vistas aéreas ya aplicados se mantienen; tendrás que volver a conectar para explorar la biblioteca de vistas aéreas de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen は Apple の空撮のローカルフォルダへの読み取りアクセスを解除します。適用中の空撮壁紙はそのまま維持されます。空撮ライブラリを再度表示するには再接続が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 将释放对本地 Apple 航拍文件夹的读取权限。已应用的航拍壁纸保持不变；如需再次浏览航拍库，请重新连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 將釋放對本機 Apple 空照圖資料夾的讀取權限。已套用的空照圖桌布保持不變；如需再次瀏覽空照圖庫，請重新連線。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen wird seinen Lesezugriff auf den lokalen Apple Aerials-Ordner freigeben. Bestehende Aerial-Hintergründe bleiben angewendet; Sie müssen sich erneut verbinden, um die Mediathek erneut zu durchsuchen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen publiera son accès en lecture au dossier local Apple Aerials. Les fonds d'écran aériens existants resteront appliqués ; vous devrez vous reconnecter pour parcourir à nouveau la bibliothèque."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen은 로컬 Apple Aerials 폴더에 대한 읽기 액세스를 공개합니다. 기존 에어리얼 배경화면이 계속 적용됩니다; 라이브러리를 다시 탐색하려면 다시 연결해야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
