    "Local development server. Loopback addresses never leave this Mac, so they run JavaScript automatically — there is nothing to revoke." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Local development server. Loopback addresses never leave this Mac, so they run JavaScript automatically — there is nothing to revoke."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Servidor de desarrollo local. Las direcciones de loopback no salen de este Mac, así que ejecutan JavaScript automáticamente — no hay nada que revocar."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ローカル開発サーバーです。ループバックアドレスはこの Mac の外に出ないため、JavaScript は自動的に実行されます。取り消す対象はありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本地开发服务器。回环地址的流量不会离开本机，因此会自动运行 JavaScript，没有可撤销的授权。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本機開發伺服器。回環位址的流量不會離開這台 Mac，因此會自動執行 JavaScript，沒有可撤銷的授權。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lokaler Entwicklungsserver. Loopback-Adressen verlassen diesen Mac nie, daher laufen sie JavaScript automatisch – es gibt nichts zu widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Serveur de développement local. Les adresses de boucle arrière ne quittent jamais ce Mac, elles s'exécutent donc automatiquement JavaScript — il n'y a rien à révoquer."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "로컬 개발 서버. 루프백 주소는 이 Mac을 떠나지 않으므로 자동으로 JavaScript을 실행합니다 — 취소할 것이 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Servidor de desenvolvimento local. Os endereços de loopback nunca deixam este Mac, então eles são executados JavaScript automaticamente — não há nada para revogar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
