    "Open Settings › Workshop › Steam connection and choose Set up SteamCMD. Loomscreen shows the download size and location before installing. Already installed it? Use Locate automatically or Choose SteamCMD." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open Settings › Workshop › Steam connection and choose Set up SteamCMD. Loomscreen shows the download size and location before installing. Already installed it? Use Locate automatically or Choose SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abre Ajustes › Workshop › Conexión de Steam y elige Configurar SteamCMD. Loomscreen muestra el tamaño de la descarga y la ubicación antes de instalar. Si ya lo tienes, usa Localizar automáticamente o Elegir SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定 › ワークショップ › Steam 接続を開き、SteamCMD の設定を選びます。Loomscreen はインストール前にダウンロード容量と保存先を表示します。インストール済みなら自動検出または SteamCMD の選択を使います。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开设置 › 创意工坊 › Steam 连接，选择“设置 SteamCMD”。Loomscreen 会在安装前显示下载体积和位置。已经安装？选择“自动查找”或“选择 SteamCMD”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟設定 › 工作坊 › Steam 連線，選擇「設定 SteamCMD」。Loomscreen 會在安裝前顯示下載大小和位置。已經安裝？選擇「自動尋找」或「選擇 SteamCMD」。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einstellungen öffnen › Workshop › Steam Verbindung öffnen und „Einrichten“ SteamCMD auswählen. Loomscreen zeigt die Download-Größe und den Speicherort vor der Installation an. Bereits installiert? Verwenden Sie „Automatisch suchen“ oder „Wählen Sie SteamCMD“."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ouvrir Paramètres › Atelier › Steam connexion et choisir Configurer SteamCMD. Loomscreen affiche la taille et l'emplacement du téléchargement avant l'installation. Déjà installé ? Utilisez Localiser automatiquement ou Choisissez SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "설정 › 워크숍 › Steam 연결을 열고 SteamCMD을 설정하십시오. Loomscreen는 설치 전에 다운로드 크기와 위치를 표시합니다. 이미 설치했습니까? 자동으로 위치를 찾으시거나 SteamCMD을 선택하십시오."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abrir Configurações › Oficina › Steam conexão e escolha Configurar SteamCMD. Loomscreen mostra o tamanho e a localização do download antes de instalar. Já o instalou? Use Localizar automaticamente ou Escolha SteamCMD."
          }
        }
      }
    },
