    "Overlays add independent clocks, weather and widgets above the wallpaper. Switch back with the wallpaper button; the display tabs choose which screen you are editing." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome Tour overlay step in an edition without the music overlay.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overlays add independent clocks, weather and widgets above the wallpaper. Switch back with the wallpaper button; the display tabs choose which screen you are editing."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las superposiciones añaden relojes, tiempo y widgets independientes. Vuelve con el botón de fondo y elige la pantalla con sus pestañas."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "壁紙の上に独立した時計・天気・ウィジェットを追加します。壁紙ボタンで設定に戻り、タブで編集ディスプレイを選びます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加层在壁纸上方添加独立的时钟、天气和小组件。壁纸按钮可切回配置层，显示器标签选择要编辑的显示器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疊加層在桌布上方加入獨立的時鐘、天氣和小工具。桌布按鈕可切回設定層，顯示器標籤選擇要編輯的顯示器。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overlays fügen unabhängige Uhren, Wetter und Widgets über dem Hintergrundbild hinzu. Wechseln Sie mit der Hintergrundbild-Taste zurück; die Anzeigefelder zeigen an, welchen Bildschirm Sie bearbeiten."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les superpositions ajoutent des horloges, des météo et des widgets indépendants au-dessus de l'arrière-plan. Retournez avec le bouton d'arrière-plan ; les onglets d'affichage indiquent l'écran sur lequel vous modifiez."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오버레이는 배경화면 위에 독립적인 시계, 날씨 및 위젯을 추가합니다. 배경화면 버튼을 사용하여 다시 전환할 수 있으며, 디스플레이 탭은 편집 중인 화면을 선택합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As sobreposições adicionam relógios, clima e widgets independentes acima do papel de parede. Volte com o botão de papel de parede; as guias de exibição selecionam qual tela você está editando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
