    },
    "Plays once when your wallpapers first appear after launch. With Reduce Motion or Low Power Mode on, it becomes a short fade-in." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › General, info for Opening animation. Reduce Motion is the macOS accessibility setting; Low Power Mode is the macOS battery setting.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plays once when your wallpapers first appear after launch. With Reduce Motion or Low Power Mode on, it becomes a short fade-in."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reproduce una vez cuando tus fondos aparecen por primera vez tras abrir la app. Con Reducir movimiento o el modo de bajo consumo activados, pasa a ser un fundido breve."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動後に壁紙が初めて表示されるときに1回だけ再生します。「視差効果を減らす」または低電力モードがオンの間は、短いフェードインになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启动后第一次显示壁纸时播放一次。开启“减弱动态效果”或低电量模式时，改为短暂的淡入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟動後第一次顯示桌布時播放一次。開啟「減少動態效果」或低耗電模式時，改為短暫的淡入。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spielt einmal, wenn Ihre Hintergrundbilder nach dem Start zum ersten Mal erscheinen. Wenn der Modus „Bewegung reduzieren“ oder „Niedriger Energieverbrauch“ aktiviert ist, wird es zu einem kurzen Fade-in."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il joue une fois lorsque vos fonds d'écran apparaissent pour la première fois après le lancement. Avec le mode Réduire le mouvement ou Faible consommation d'énergie activé, il devient une courte transition d'entrée."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "시작 후 배경화면이 처음 나타날 때 한 번 재생됩니다. 모션 감소 또는 저전력 모드를 켜면 짧은 페이드인으로 변합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "É reproduzido uma vez quando seus papéis de parede aparecem pela primeira vez após o lançamento. Com o Modo Reduzir Movimento ou Baixa Energia ativado, ele se torna um fade-in curto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plays when a display switches wallpapers, and more slowly when automation switches them. With Reduce Motion or Low Power Mode on, animated transitions become a short crossfade." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › General, info for Wallpaper transition. Reduce Motion is the macOS accessibility setting; Low Power Mode is the macOS battery setting.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plays when a display switches wallpapers, and more slowly when automation switches them. With Reduce Motion or Low Power Mode on, animated transitions become a short crossfade."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reproduce cuando una pantalla cambia de fondo, y más despacio cuando lo cambia la automatización. Con Reducir movimiento o el modo de bajo consumo activados, las transiciones animadas pasan a ser un fundido encadenado breve."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ディスプレイの壁紙が切り替わるときに再生し、自動切り替えのときはゆっくり再生します。「視差効果を減らす」または低電力モードがオンの間は、アニメーションが短いクロスフェードになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示器切换壁纸时播放，自动轮换时放慢。开启“减弱动态效果”或低电量模式时，动画改为短暂的淡入淡出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "顯示器切換桌布時播放，自動輪換時放慢。開啟「減少動態效果」或低耗電模式時，動畫改為短暫的淡入淡出。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spielt, wenn ein Display Hintergrundbilder wechselt, und langsamer, wenn die Automatisierung sie wechselt. Mit Reduzierte Bewegung oder Energiesparmodus aktiviert werden animierte Übergänge zu einem kurzen Crossfade."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "S'affiche lorsque l'écran change de fond d'écran, et plus lentement lorsque l'automatisation le change. Avec le mode Réduire le mouvement ou Faible consommation d'énergie activé, les transitions animées deviennent une courte transition croisée."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "디스플레이가 배경화면을 전환할 때 재생되며, 자동화가 배경화면을 전환할 때는 더 천천히 재생됩니다. Reduce Motion 또는 Low Power 모드를 켜면 애니메이션 전환이 짧은 크로스페이드가 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Funciona quando uma tela troca os papéis de parede e, mais lentamente, quando a automação as troca. Com o Modo Reduzir Movimento ou Baixa Energia ativado, as transições animadas se tornam um fade cruzado curto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
