    "Removes the stored key from this Mac. Your key remains active under your Steam account at steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey until you revoke it there." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip on the Forget button in WorkshopSettingsView.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elimina la clave almacenada de este Mac. La clave sigue activa en tu cuenta de Steam en steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey hasta que la revoques allí."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存されたキーをこの Mac から削除します。steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey で取り消すまで、キーは Steam アカウント上で有効なままです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从本机移除已存储的密钥。在你前往 steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey 撤销之前，该密钥仍会在你的 Steam 账户下保持有效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從這台 Mac 移除已儲存的金鑰。在你前往 steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey 撤銷之前，該金鑰仍會在你的 Steam 帳戶下保持有效。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entfernt den gespeicherten Schlüssel von diesem Mac. Ihr Schlüssel bleibt unter Ihrem Steam-Konto auf steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey aktiv, bis Sie ihn dort widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supprime la clé stockée de ce Mac. Votre clé reste active sous votre compte Steam sur steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey jusqu'à ce que vous la révoquiez là-bas."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac에서 저장된 키를 제거합니다. 귀하의 키는 steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey에 있는 Steam 계정 아래에서 귀하가 거기서 취소할 때까지 활성 상태로 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remove a chave armazenada deste Mac. Sua chave permanece ativa sob sua conta Steam em steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey até que você a revogue lá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes this account's Loomscreen download session. Reconnect before downloading again. Steam app sign-in is unaffected." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation for removing the selected Steam account download session used by Loomscreen. The Steam app session remains signed in.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Removes this account's Loomscreen download session. Reconnect before downloading again. Steam app sign-in is unaffected."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elimina la sesión de descarga de esta cuenta en Loomscreen. Vuelve a conectarla antes de descargar. La sesión de la app Steam no cambia."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このアカウントの Loomscreen ダウンロードセッションを削除します。次のダウンロード前に再接続が必要です。Steam アプリのログイン状態には影響しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除此账户在 Loomscreen 中的下载会话。再次下载前需重新连接；不影响 Steam 应用的登录状态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除此帳號在 Loomscreen 中的下載工作階段。再次下載前需重新連線；不影響 Steam 應用程式的登入狀態。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entfernt die Loomscreen-Download-Sitzung dieses Kontos. Melden Sie sich erneut an, bevor Sie erneut herunterladen. Steam-App-Anmeldung ist unbeeinträchtigt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supprime la session de téléchargement Loomscreen de ce compte. Connectez-vous à nouveau avant de télécharger à nouveau. La connexion à l'application Steam n'est pas affectée."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 계정의 Loomscreen 다운로드 세션을 제거합니다. 다시 다운로드하기 전에 다시 연결하십시오. Steam 앱 로그인은 영향을 받지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remove a sessão de download Loomscreen desta conta. Reconecte-se antes de fazer o download novamente. O login do aplicativo Steam não é afetado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
