    "Scene resources are read only. Loomscreen never modifies a Wallpaper Engine install, and downloading one requires a Steam account that already owns it." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop privacy statement about the Wallpaper Engine assets.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los recursos de escena son de solo lectura. Loomscreen nunca modifica una instalación de Wallpaper Engine, y descargarla requiere una cuenta de Steam que ya la posea."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シーンリソースは読み取り専用です。Loomscreen が Wallpaper Engine のインストールを変更することはなく、ダウンロードにはそれを所有している Steam アカウントが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "场景资源是只读的。Loomscreen 绝不会修改 Wallpaper Engine 的安装，下载则需要一个已经拥有它的 Steam 账户。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "場景資源是唯讀的。Loomscreen 絕不會修改 Wallpaper Engine 的安裝，下載則需要一個已經擁有它的 Steam 帳戶。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Szenenressourcen werden nur gelesen. Loomscreen verändert keine Wallpaper Engine-Installation. Zum Herunterladen wird ein Steam-Konto benötigt, das Wallpaper Engine bereits besitzt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les ressources de scène sont en lecture seule. Loomscreen ne modifie jamais une installation de Wallpaper Engine. Son téléchargement nécessite un compte Steam qui possède déjà Wallpaper Engine."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "장면 리소스는 읽기 전용입니다. Loomscreen은 Wallpaper Engine 설치 파일을 수정하지 않습니다. 다운로드하려면 Wallpaper Engine을 이미 보유한 Steam 계정이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os recursos de cena são somente leitura. O Loomscreen nunca modifica uma instalação do Wallpaper Engine. Para baixá-la, é necessário usar uma conta Steam que já possua o Wallpaper Engine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scene settings reset" : {
      "comment" : "Toast after a scene's custom settings were reset in the Edit Desk; it offers Undo.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scene settings reset"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se restablecieron los ajustes de la escena"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
