    "Thanks for downloading Loomscreen! Loomscreen is a menu bar app. Closing this window keeps wallpapers running. Click its menu bar icon and choose Manage to return. Show in Dock in General settings also makes the app available in the Dock and Command-Tab." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome Tour introduction or optional Workshop settings action.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thanks for downloading Loomscreen! Loomscreen is a menu bar app. Closing this window keeps wallpapers running. Click its menu bar icon and choose Manage to return. Show in Dock in General settings also makes the app available in the Dock and Command-Tab."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¡Gracias por descargar Loomscreen! Loomscreen se ejecuta en la barra de menús. Los fondos siguen funcionando al cerrar esta ventana. Haz clic en su icono y elige Gestionar para volver. Activa Mostrar en el Dock en los ajustes generales para acceder también desde el Dock y con Command-Tab."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen をダウンロードしていただき、ありがとうございます！Loomscreen はメニューバーに常駐します。このウインドウを閉じても壁紙は動き続けます。メニューバーアイコンから「管理」を選ぶと、この画面に戻れます。「一般」設定で「Dock に表示」を有効にすると、Dock や Command-Tab からもアプリを開けます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢下载 Loomscreen！Loomscreen 常驻菜单栏，关闭此窗口后壁纸仍会继续播放。点按菜单栏图标并选择“管理”即可返回。在“通用”设置中启用“在 Dock 中显示”，还可通过 Dock 或 Command-Tab 切换到本应用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感謝下載 Loomscreen！Loomscreen 常駐選單列，關閉此視窗後桌布仍會繼續播放。按一下選單列圖示並選擇「管理」即可返回。在「一般」設定中啟用「在 Dock 中顯示」，也可透過 Dock 或 Command-Tab 切換至本 App。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vielen Dank für das Herunterladen von Loomscreen! Loomscreen ist eine Menüleiste-App. Das Schließen dieses Fensters lässt Hintergrundbilder weiterhin laufen. Klicken Sie auf das Menüleisten-Symbol und wählen Sie „Verwalten“, um zurückzukehren. Das Anzeigen im Dock in den allgemeinen Einstellungen macht die App ebenfalls im Dock und im Command-Tab verfügbar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Merci d'avoir téléchargé Loomscreen ! Loomscreen est une application de barre de menu. Fermer cette fenêtre maintient les fonds d'écran en cours d'exécution. Cliquez sur l'icône de sa barre de menu et choisissez Gérer pour revenir. Afficher dans le Dock dans les paramètres généraux rend également l'application disponible dans le Dock et dans l'onglet Commande."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen을 다운로드해 주셔서 감사합니다! Loomscreen은 메뉴바 앱입니다. 이 창을 닫으면 배경화면이 계속 실행됩니다. 메뉴바 아이콘을 클릭하고 '관리'를 선택하여 돌아가세요. 일반 설정에서 '데스크톱에 표시'를 선택하면 앱이 데스크톱과 명령-탭에서도 사용할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obrigado por baixar Loomscreen! Loomscreen é um aplicativo de barra de menus. Fechar esta janela mantém os papéis de parede funcionando. Clique no ícone da barra de menus e escolha Gerenciar para retornar. Mostrar no Dock nas configurações gerais também torna o aplicativo disponível no Dock e no Comando-Tab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That binary is quarantined. Open it once in Finder, or remove the quarantine flag." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop setup error when the chosen SteamCMD still carries the quarantine flag.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That binary is quarantined. Open it once in Finder, or remove the quarantine flag."
          }
