    "The preview selector can show sample data. Check the actual desktop for live values. Weather needs a location in Settings › Integrations." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome Tour overlay step in an edition without the music overlay.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The preview selector can show sample data. Check the actual desktop for live values. Weather needs a location in Settings › Integrations."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El selector puede mostrar datos de ejemplo. Consulta valores reales en el escritorio. El tiempo necesita ubicación en Ajustes › Integraciones."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "プレビューではサンプルを表示できます。実際の値はデスクトップで確認してください。天気は「設定 › 連携」の位置情報が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "预览选择器可显示示例数据，实时数值请查看实际桌面。天气需要在“设置 › 系统联动”配置位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預覽選擇器可顯示範例資料，即時數值請查看實際桌面。天氣需要在「設定 › 系統整合」設定位置。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Vorschaubegriff kann Beispieldaten anzeigen. Überprüfen Sie den tatsächlichen Desktop auf Live-Werte. Das Wetter benötigt einen Standort in Einstellungen › Integrationen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le sélecteur de prévisualisation peut afficher des données d'exemple. Vérifiez l'écran de bureau pour les valeurs en direct. La météo nécessite une localisation dans Paramètres › Intégrations."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "프리뷰 선택기는 샘플 데이터를 표시할 수 있습니다. 실제 데스크톱에서 실시간 값을 확인하세요. 날씨는 설정 › 통합에서 위치가 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O seletor de prévia pode exibir dados de amostra. Verifique a área de trabalho real para valores em tempo real. O clima precisa de uma localização em Configurações › Integrações."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The preview selector can show sample data. Check the actual desktop for live values. Weather needs a location in Settings › Integrations; music needs a supported player." : {
