            "value" : "The selected folder doesn't contain Wallpaper Engine assets. Choose the wallpaper_engine install folder or Wallpaper Engine.app."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La carpeta seleccionada no contiene recursos de Wallpaper Engine. Elige la carpeta de instalación wallpaper_engine o Wallpaper Engine.app."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選択したフォルダに Wallpaper Engine アセットが含まれていません。wallpaper_engine インストールフォルダまたは Wallpaper Engine.app を選択してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选文件夹不包含 Wallpaper Engine 资源。请选择 wallpaper_engine 安装文件夹或 Wallpaper Engine.app。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所選資料夾不包含 Wallpaper Engine 資源。請選擇 wallpaper_engine 安裝資料夾或 Wallpaper Engine.app。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das ausgewählte Verzeichnis enthält keine Wallpaper Engine-Assets. Wählen Sie das Installationsverzeichnis von wallpaper_engine oder Wallpaper Engine.app."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le dossier sélectionné ne contient pas d'actifs Wallpaper Engine. Choisissez le dossier d'installation wallpaper_engine ou Wallpaper Engine.app."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "선택된 폴더에는 Wallpaper Engine 자산이 포함되어 있지 않습니다. wallpaper_engine 설치 폴더 또는 Wallpaper Engine.app을 선택하십시오."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A pasta selecionada não contém ativos Wallpaper Engine. Escolha a pasta de instalação wallpaper_engine ou Wallpaper Engine.app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service restarted, but no new connection was confirmed. Choose the Loomscreen tile in System Settings › Wallpaper again." : {
      "comment" : "System Wallpaper maintenance result after a restart without a confirmed reconnection.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The service restarted, but no new connection was confirmed. Choose the Loomscreen tile in System Settings › Wallpaper again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servicio se reinició, pero no se confirmó ninguna conexión nueva. Vuelve a elegir el mosaico de Loomscreen en Ajustes del Sistema › Fondo de pantalla."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サービスは再起動しましたが、新しい接続を確認できませんでした。システム設定 › 壁紙で Loomscreen のタイルをもう一度選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务已重新启动，但尚未确认新的扩展连接。请在“系统设置 › 墙纸”里重新选择 Loomscreen 的磁贴。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服務已重新啟動，但尚未確認新的延伸功能連線。請在「系統設定 › 背景圖片」裡重新選擇 Loomscreen 的拼貼。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Dienst wurde neu gestartet, aber keine neue Verbindung wurde bestätigt. Wählen Sie erneut die Loomscreen-Kachel in Systemeinstellungen › Hintergrundbild."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le service a été redémarré, mais aucune nouvelle connexion n'a été confirmée. Choisissez à nouveau la tuile Loomscreen dans Réglages Système › Fond d'écran."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "서비스가 다시 시작되었지만 새로운 연결이 확인되지 않았습니다. 시스템 설정 › 배경화면에서 Loomscreen 타일을 다시 선택하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O serviço foi reiniciado, mas nenhuma nova conexão foi confirmada. Escolha novamente a grade Loomscreen em Ajustes do Sistema › papel de parede."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Settings button opens the right panel with this wallpaper's properties. Changes affect the selected display." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Settings button opens the right panel with this wallpaper's properties. Changes affect the selected display."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El botón Ajustes abre a la derecha las propiedades de este fondo. Los cambios afectan a la pantalla seleccionada."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定ボタンで右側にこの壁紙のプロパティを開きます。変更は選択したディスプレイに適用されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置按钮会打开右侧的壁纸属性面板，修改作用于所选显示器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定按鈕會開啟右側的桌布屬性面板，修改作用於所選顯示器。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Schaltfläche Einstellungen öffnet das rechte Panel mit den Eigenschaften dieses Hintergrundbildes. Änderungen wirken sich auf die ausgewählte Anzeige aus."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le bouton Paramètres ouvre le panneau droit avec les propriétés de cette image de fond d'écran. Les modifications affectent l'affichage sélectionné."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "설정 버튼을 클릭하면 이 배경화면 속성이 포함된 오른쪽 패널이 열립니다. 변경 사항은 선택된 디스플레이에 영향을 미칩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O botão Configurações abre o painel direito com as propriedades desta imagem de fundo. As alterações afetam a exibição selecionada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sidebar groups settings by task. Search finds both pages and individual settings; the information buttons explain their scope and effects." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sidebar groups settings by task. Search finds both pages and individual settings; the information buttons explain their scope and effects."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La barra lateral agrupa por tarea. La búsqueda localiza páginas y ajustes; los botones de información explican alcance y efectos."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サイドバーは操作別に分類されています。検索はページや個別の設定を探せます。情報ボタンで適用範囲と効果を確認できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "边栏按任务分组。搜索可定位页面和具体设置；信息按钮说明设置的作用范围与效果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "側邊欄依任務分組。搜尋可定位頁面和具體設定；資訊按鈕說明設定的作用範圍與效果。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Seitenleiste gruppiert die Einstellungen nach Aufgaben. Die Suche findet sowohl Seiten als auch individuelle Einstellungen; die Informationsschaltflächen erklären ihren Umfang und ihre Auswirkungen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La barre latérale regroupe les paramètres par tâche. La recherche trouve à la fois les pages et les paramètres individuels ; les boutons d'information expliquent leur portée et leurs effets."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사이드바는 작업을 기준으로 설정을 그룹화합니다. 검색은 양쪽 페이지와 개별 설정을 모두 찾을 수 있으며, 정보 버튼은 그 범위와 영향을 설명합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A barra lateral agrupa as configurações por tarefa. A busca encontra tanto páginas quanto configurações individuais; os botões de informações explicam seu escopo e efeitos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The specific cause is not yet known." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
