    "The wallpaper button opens this display's configuration layer. The stacked-layers button opens its overlay editor. Display tabs switch the target; the back arrow returns to Overview." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The wallpaper button opens this display's configuration layer. The stacked-layers button opens its overlay editor. Display tabs switch the target; the back arrow returns to Overview."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El botón de fondo abre la configuración; el de capas, el editor de superposiciones. Las pestañas cambian de pantalla y la flecha vuelve a Vista general."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "壁紙ボタンはこのディスプレイの設定、積層ボタンはオーバーレイ編集を開きます。タブで対象ディスプレイを切り替え、戻る矢印で全景に戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "壁纸按钮打开当前显示器的配置层，图层按钮打开叠加层编辑器。显示器标签切换目标，返回箭头回到全景。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "桌布按鈕開啟目前顯示器的設定層，圖層按鈕開啟疊加層編輯器。顯示器標籤切換目標，返回箭頭回到全景。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Hintergrundbild-Taste öffnet die Konfigurationsschicht dieser Anzeige. Die Schaltfläche für gestapelte Schichten öffnet ihren Überlagerungseditor. Die Anzeigeflachelemente-Tabs wechseln das Ziel; der Rückwärtssymbol-Pfeil kehrt zur Übersicht zurück."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le bouton Fond d'écran ouvre la couche de configuration de cet affichage. Le bouton Couches superposées ouvre son éditeur d'interposition. Les onglets d'affichage permettent de basculer la cible ; la flèche arrière revient à Aperçu."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "배경화면 버튼을 클릭하면 이 디스플레이의 구성 계층이 열립니다. 스택된 계층 버튼을 클릭하면 오버레이 편집기가 열립니다. 디스플레이 탭을 사용하면 대상이 변경되며, 뒤로 화살표를 클릭하면 개요로 돌아갑니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O botão de papel de fundo abre a camada de configuração desta tela. O botão de camadas empilhadas abre seu editor de sobreposição. As guias de exibição alternam o alvo; a seta para trás retorna para Visão Geral."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Wallpaper Library can't add this kind of file." : {
