    "Up to once a week, update checks include your Mac model, processor, memory, macOS version, language, and display count and resolution range. No identifiers are sent. Used to tune resource use." : {
      "comment" : "Settings explanation; preserve scope and consequences.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Up to once a week, update checks include your Mac model, processor, memory, macOS version, language, and display count and resolution range. No identifiers are sent. Used to tune resource use."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Como máximo una vez por semana, las búsquedas de actualizaciones incluyen el modelo de Mac, el procesador, la memoria, la versión de macOS, el idioma, y el número de pantallas y su rango de resolución. No se envía ningún identificador. Se utiliza para optimizar el uso de recursos."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アップデートの確認時に、週に 1 回まで Mac のモデル、プロセッサ、メモリ、macOS のバージョン、言語、ディスプレイの数と解像度の区分を送信します。識別子は送信されません。リソース使用量の最適化にのみ使用されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查更新时每周最多附带一次 Mac 机型、处理器、内存、macOS 版本、语言，以及显示器数量和分辨率档位。不含任何标识符，仅用于优化资源占用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檢查更新時每週最多附帶一次 Mac 機型、處理器、記憶體、macOS 版本、語言，以及顯示器數量與解析度級距。不含任何識別碼，僅用於最佳化資源使用。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bis zu einmal pro Woche enthalten die Update-Prüfungen Ihr Mac-Modell, Prozessor, Speicher, macOS-Version, Sprache sowie die Anzahl der Bildschirme und der Bereich der Auflösung. Es werden keine Identifikatoren gesendet. Dient zur Optimierung des Ressourcennutzungsverbrauchs."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jusqu'une fois par semaine, les vérifications de mise à jour incluent votre modèle de Mac, le processeur, la mémoire, la version macOS, la langue et le nombre d'écrans ainsi que la plage de résolution. Aucun identifiant n'est envoyé. Utilisé pour optimiser l'utilisation des ressources."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "일주에 한 번까지 업데이트 확인에는 Mac 모델, 프로세서, 메모리, macOS 버전, 언어 및 디스플레이 개수와 해상도 범위가 포함됩니다. 식별자는 전송되지 않습니다. 리소스 사용을 조정하는 데 사용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Até uma vez por semana, as verificações de atualização incluem o modelo do seu Mac, processador, memória, versão macOS, idioma e contagem de tela e faixa de resolução. Nenhum identificador é enviado. Usado para ajustar o uso de recursos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update" : {
      "comment" : "Button or menu item that installs a newer version: the app (menu bar, Settings), a Workshop wallpaper, or the Wallpaper Engine assets. Also the badge on an installed Workshop wallpaper's card when Steam has a newer version. In the classic bookmark popover it saves the edited name.",
