    "Use Save as Scheme in display details to capture a display's wallpaper, overlays, and settings together. Applying one replaces all of them." : {
      "comment" : "Empty scheme library: names the Save as Scheme action and states that a scheme replaces the whole display setup.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Save as Scheme in display details to capture a display's wallpaper, overlays, and settings together. Applying one replaces all of them."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selecciona «Guardar como esquema» en los detalles de la pantalla para guardar juntos el fondo, las superposiciones y los ajustes. Al aplicarlo se reemplazan todos."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ディスプレイの詳細で「構成として保存」を選ぶと、壁紙、オーバーレイ、設定をまとめて保存できます。適用するとそれらがすべて置き換わります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在显示器详情中选择“保存为方案”，将壁纸、叠加层和设置一并保存。应用方案会整套替换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在顯示器詳細資訊中選擇「儲存為方案」，將桌布、疊加層與設定一併儲存。套用方案會整套取代。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit „Als Profil sichern“ in den Monitordetails sichern Sie Hintergrund, Überlagerungen und Einstellungen gemeinsam. Beim Anwenden eines Profils werden alle diese Elemente ersetzt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilisez « Enregistrer comme configuration » dans les détails du moniteur pour conserver ensemble le fond d’écran, les calques et les réglages. L’application d’une configuration remplace tous ces éléments."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "디스플레이 세부사항에서 ‘구성으로 저장’을 사용하면 배경화면, 오버레이 및 설정을 함께 저장할 수 있습니다. 구성을 적용하면 이 항목들이 모두 교체됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Salvar como configuração nos detalhes do monitor para guardar o papel de parede, as camadas e os ajustes juntos. Aplicar uma configuração substitui todos esses elementos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use search, filters, sort and time range to find wallpapers. Click a result for details. A Steam Web API key is optional; its settings explain the extra information it enables." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use search, filters, sort and time range to find wallpapers. Click a result for details. A Steam Web API key is optional; its settings explain the extra information it enables."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Busca con filtros, orden y período; haz clic para ver detalles. La clave de Steam Web API es opcional y sus ajustes explican qué información añade."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "検索・フィルタ・並べ替え・期間で壁紙を探し、クリックで詳細を表示します。Steam Web API キーは任意です。追加情報は設定で説明しています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过搜索、筛选、排序和时间范围查找壁纸，点击结果查看详情。Steam Web API key 为可选项，设置中会解释它提供的额外信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過搜尋、篩選、排序和時間範圍尋找桌布，點按結果查看詳細資訊。Steam Web API key 為選用項目，設定中會解釋它提供的額外資訊。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwenden Sie Suche, Filter, Sortierung und Zeitbereich, um Hintergrundbilder zu finden. Klicken Sie auf ein Ergebnis für Details. Ein Steam Web API-Schlüssel ist optional; seine Einstellungen erklären die zusätzlichen Informationen, die er ermöglicht."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilisez la recherche, les filtres, le tri et la plage de temps pour trouver des fonds d'écran. Cliquez sur un résultat pour plus de détails. Une clé Web Steam API est facultative ; ses paramètres expliquent les informations supplémentaires qu'elle permet d'obtenir."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "검색, 필터링, 정렬 및 시간 범위를 사용하여 배경화면을 찾으세요. 자세한 내용은 결과를 클릭하세요.Steam 웹API 키는 선택 사항이며, 설정에 추가 정보를 제공하는 방법을 설명합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use pesquisa, filtros, classificação e intervalo de tempo para encontrar wallpapers. Clique em um resultado para obter detalhes. Uma chave Steam Web API é opcional; suas configurações explicam as informações adicionais que ela permite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
