    "Wallpaper Engine assets are linked, but their installed version could not be determined. You can keep using them, or choose Update to download the current version." : {
      "comment" : "Managed assets remain usable but have no comparable build ID; Update downloads a known current build.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine assets are linked, but their installed version could not be determined. You can keep using them, or choose Update to download the current version."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los recursos compartidos de Wallpaper Engine están vinculados, pero no se pudo determinar la versión instalada. Puedes seguir usándolos o elegir Actualizar para descargar la versión actual."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine の共有アセットはリンク済みですが、インストール済みのバージョンを確認できません。そのまま使用するか、「更新」で現在のバージョンをダウンロードできます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine 共享资源已关联，但无法确认其已安装版本。可以继续使用，也可以点按“更新”下载当前版本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine 共用資源已連結，但無法確認其已安裝版本。可以繼續使用，也可以按一下「更新」下載目前版本。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine Assets sind verknüpft, aber ihre installierte Version konnte nicht bestimmt werden. Sie können sie weiterhin verwenden oder die Option Aktualisieren wählen, um die aktuelle Version herunterzuladen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine les actifs sont liés, mais leur version installée ne pourrait pas être déterminée. Vous pouvez continuer à les utiliser, ou choisir Mettre à jour pour télécharger la version actuelle."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine 자산이 연결되어 있지만 설치된 버전은 결정할 수 없습니다. 계속 사용하거나 현재 버전을 다운로드하려면 업데이트를 선택할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine os ativos estão vinculados, mas sua versão instalada não pôde ser determinada. Você pode continuar usando-os, ou escolher Atualizar para baixar a versão atual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
