    "Workshop requests go straight to Valve over HTTPS. Nothing is sent to Loomscreen, and Loomscreen runs no server of its own." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop privacy statement about where requests go.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las solicitudes de Workshop van directas a Valve por HTTPS. No se envía nada a Loomscreen, y Loomscreen no ejecuta ningún servidor propio."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ワークショップへのリクエストは HTTPS で Valve に直接送られます。Loomscreen には何も送信されず、Loomscreen 自身のサーバーは存在しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "创意工坊请求通过 HTTPS 直接发给 Valve。没有任何内容发往 Loomscreen，Loomscreen 也不运行自己的服务器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工作坊請求透過 HTTPS 直接發給 Valve。沒有任何內容發往 Loomscreen，Loomscreen 也不執行自己的伺服器。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Workshop-Anfragen gehen direkt über HTTPS an Valve. Nichts wird an Loomscreen gesendet, und Loomscreen betreibt keinen eigenen Server."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les demandes de ateliers sont directement envoyées à Valve via HTTPS. Rien n'est envoyé à Loomscreen, et Loomscreen ne fait aucun serveur en propre."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "워크숍 요청은 HTTPS를 통해 Valve로 직접 전달됩니다. Loomscreen으로 아무것도 전송되지 않으며, Loomscreen은 자체 서버를 실행하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os pedidos de workshop vão diretamente para a Valve via HTTPS. Nada é enviado para Loomscreen, e Loomscreen não opera nenhum servidor próprio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
